###############################################################################
SSH Jump for AXIS OS
###############################################################################

SSH Jump — ACAP web terminal / SSH jump host for Axis devices
Version 1.0.0
Copyright (c) 2026 Filipe Brigido. All rights reserved.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. LICENSE GRANT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Subject to the terms below, the copyright holder ("Author") grants the owner or
authorized operator of the Axis device on which this application is installed
("You") a non-exclusive, non-transferable, royalty-free license to install and
use this application ("Software") on Axis devices that You own or are authorized
to administer, for the purpose of administering devices on Your own local
network.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. PERMITTED USE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software provides an interactive SSH terminal, reachable through the Axis
device web interface, that opens outbound SSH connections to hosts You specify.
It is intended solely for legitimate administration of network equipment that
You own or are otherwise expressly authorized to access.

You agree to use the Software only in a manner that is:
  (a) consistent with all applicable laws and regulations;
  (b) consistent with the terms of service and license agreements of any
      device or system You connect to; and
  (c) within the scope of authorization You hold for each target device.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. RESTRICTIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You shall NOT use the Software to access, scan, probe, or interfere with any
system, network, or device for which You do not hold explicit authorization.
Unauthorized access to computer systems is prohibited and may be a criminal
offense. You are solely responsible for how the Software is used and for any
consequences arising from connections established through it.

You shall not remove or alter any copyright, trademark, or attribution notices
contained in the Software or this document.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. SECURITY NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software listens only on the device loopback interface; all external access
is mediated by the Axis device web server, reusing its authentication and TLS.
Credentials entered into the terminal are used only to establish the requested
SSH connection and are not persisted by the Software. Host key verification is
performed on a trust-on-use basis, with the server fingerprint presented for
manual verification. As a safeguard, the Software automatically stops after a
configurable period of inactivity (default 30 minutes).

